    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Emperor’s Chosen",
    "summary": "Each time you select an ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit of yours to attack, its attacks may re-roll one Hit roll and one Wound roll. The detachment also has Favoured ka’tah: Rendax, which gives this Additional Effect: you may choose an enemy MONSTER/VEHICLE unit that is engaged with yours and roll a D6. A 1-2 inflicts 1 mortal wound on it, a 3-5 inflicts D3 mortal wounds, and a 6 inflicts 3 mortal wounds.",
